   "titulo": "The positions are names",
   "texto": [
    "In Japanese «on top», «below» or «inside» are **nombres**, and they are attached to the object with **の**: **テーブル の うえ** (above the table; literally «on top of the table»).",
    "The order is the opposite of the Spanish: first the object, then the position.",
    "To say where something is: **A は B の うえ に あります** (A is above B)."
